abstract: "Local lossless compression engine in plain C (TriNeural Shared Spine Row Compression). Submitted to Matt Mahoney's Silesia benchmark as TNSSRC 0.1.0 at 43,724,575 bytes; decode+SHA-256 verified on all 12 files 2026-09-18. Never expands output beyond input size."
